	unregister_pernet_subsys(&sctp_defaults_ops);
err_register_defaults:
	sctp_v4_pf_exit();
	sctp_v6_pf_exit();
	sctp_sysctl_unregister();
	...
```

- **There is NO call to unregister_pernet_subsys(&sctp_ctrlsock_ops);**

#### For sctp_defaults_ops
If register_pernet_subsys(&sctp_defaults_ops) fails:
```c
goto err_register_defaults;
...
err_register_defaults:
	sctp_v4_pf_exit();
	sctp_v6_pf_exit();
	sctp_sysctl_unregister();
